# Build-context allowlist for images built from the repo root
# (docker/blocks-runner.Dockerfile and docker/control.Dockerfile): everything is
# excluded except the packages those images install, so local venvs, the
# frontend, git history etc. never reach the docker daemon.
*
!manta-blocks
!manta-runtime
manta-blocks/.venv
manta-runtime/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
